==== Status ====

(05.03.2019)

  * Boot: working
  * Serial Port: working
  * Wifi: working (disabled by default) -> press WLan button or via [[/docs/guide-quick-start/sshadministration|ssh]]: ''uci set wireless.radio0.disabled='0' -> uci commit''
  * DHCP: working
  * Ethernet: working
  * ADSL: should be working, tested @TestBuild (AnnexB ATM & PTM) -> default: Annex A not enabled in Kernel
  * LEDs: working, "red_info_LED" does not exist
  * LuCI: flash firmware working
  * SMP: working -> [[toh/avm/fritz.box.wlan.7312#linux_414x_smp|bootlogs]]

-> TestBuild: Ethernet working, ADSL-Uplink [[fritz.box.wlan.7312#adsl_config|has to be configured]] -> [[https://wiki.freifunk-cottbus.de/_media/firmware:fritzbox7312:2017.09.07_freifunk-berlin-1.0.0-olsrd0903-alpha-f2728cc-fritz7320-sysupgrade.tar.gz|FritzBox7312 Freifunk Berlin LEDE 1.0.0-olsrd0903-alpha, 04.09.2017]], further
 [[https://wiki.freifunk-cottbus.de/firmware:downloads|info]]


