===== Serial =====
-> [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial]] general information about the serial port, serial port cable, etc.

serial mode: 115200,n,8,1,hw

How to connect to the Serial Port of this specific device:
|  | 3V3 | RX | TX | GND | Software (Linux) |
| Board | square | circle | circle | circle |
| [[docs:techref:hardware:port.serial.cables#data_cable_for_siemens_cell_phones|Siemens Data Cable]] | | white | blue| black | sudo screen /dev/ttyUSB0 115200 |
| | | | | | [[http://cutecom.sourceforge.net/|Cutecom]]: Rate: 115200, Flow: none, Data: 8, Stop: 1, Parity: none -> no input [[fritz.box.wlan.7330#ftp|@BoxFTPMode]] -> use screen |


===== Flashing =====

==== Backup Firmware ====

backup via FTP did work **once** for: "(AVM) EVA Revision: 1.1820 Version: 2820" -> [[fritz.box.wlan.7112#ftp|FritzBox7112 backup Firmware]]

after flashing different Firmware now it does not any more o.O -> use [[fritz.box.wlan.7112#serial_tftp|tftp]]

