==== Build/Enable SMP kernel ====

  * [[docs:guide-developer:toolchain:install-buildsystem|Build system – Installation]]
  * [[docs:guide-developer:toolchain:use-buildsystem|Build system – Usage]]
  * [[docs:guide-developer:toolchain:use-buildsystem#image_configurationrun|Image Configuration]]
  * ''make menuconfig'' -> Target System: ''Lantiq'' -> Subtarget: ''XWAY'' -> Target Profile: ''AVM FRITZ!Box 7312'' -> Exit & Save

=== Kernel 5.4 ===
  * check/remove -> ''/openwrt/target/linux/lantiq/files/arch/mips/boot/dts/lantiq/ar9_avm_fritz7312.dts'' -> ''bootargs'' -> ''"nosmp"''
  * ''make kernel_menuconfig'' -> Kernel type -> ''[*] MIPS MT SMP support'' & ''[*] SMT (multithreading)'' & ''[*] Dynamic FPU affinity'' -> Exit & Save
  * ''make kernel_menuconfig'' -> Device Drivers -> Remoteproc drivers -> ''[*] Support for Remote Processor subsystem '' -> Exit & Save
  * additional: ''make menuconfig'' -> Base system -> busybox -> ''[*] Customize busybox options'' -> Process Utilities -> top -> ''[*] Accept keyboard commands'' & ''[*] Show CPU per-process usage percentage'' & ''[*]Show CPU global usage percentage'' & ''[*] SMP CPU usage display ('c' key)'' -> Exit & Save
  * [[docs:guide-developer:toolchain:use-buildsystem#building_images|Build Image]] -> ''make V=s -jX'' <- set ''j'' to build system CPU cores + 1
  * [[docs:guide-developer:toolchain:use-buildsystem#locating_images|Locate Firmware Image]] and [[/docs/guide-user/installation/generic.flashing.ftp|Flash]]

=== Kernel 4.14 ===
  * ''make kernel_menuconfig'' -> Kernel type -> ''[*] MIPS MT SMP support'' -> ''[*] SMT (multithreading)'' -> Exit & Save
  * ''make menuconfig'' -> Utilities -> ''<*> irqbalance''
  * check/remove -> ''/openwrt/target/linux/lantiq/files/arch/mips/boot/dts/lantiq/ar9_avm_fritz7312.dts'' -> ''bootargs'' -> ''"nosmp"''
  * additional: ''make menuconfig'' -> Base system -> busybox -> Process Utilities -> top -> ''[*] Accept keyboard commands'' & ''[*] SMP CPU usage display ('c' key)'' -> Exit & Save
  * [[docs:guide-developer:toolchain:use-buildsystem#building_images|Build Image]] -> ''make V=s -j3'' <- set ''j'' to build system CPU cores + 1
  * [[docs:guide-developer:toolchain:use-buildsystem#locating_images|Locate Firmware Image]] and [[/docs/guide-user/installation/generic.flashing.ftp|Flash]]
  * additional: irqbalance autostart -> boot up box and [[/docs/guide-quick-start/sshadministration|ssh]] -> ''vi /etc/rc.local'' -> press ''i'' add ''/usr/sbin/irqbalance'' -> press ''ESC'' -> press ''shift''+'':'' -> press ''wq'' -> press ''ENTER'' -> ''reboot''
===== ADSL config =====

-> [[docs:guide-user:base-system:uci|console login]]
	ssh root@192.168.1.1
	uci show network

	network.atm=atm-bridge
	network.atm.vpi='1'
	network.atm.vci='32'
	network.atm.encaps='llc'
	network.atm.payload='bridged'
	network.dsl=dsl
	network.dsl.firmware='/lib/firmware/adsl.bin'
	network.dsl.annex='b'
	network.dsl.xfer_mode='atm'
	network.lan=interface
	network.lan.type='bridge'
	network.lan.ifname='eth0'
	network.lan.proto='static'
	network.lan.ipaddr='192.168.1.1'
	network.lan.netmask='255.255.255.0'
	network.lan.ip6assign='60'
	network.wan=interface
	network.wan.ifname='nas0'
	network.wan.proto='pppoe'
	network.wan.ipv6='auto'
	network.wan.username='Set_Username'
	network.wan.password='Set_Password'
	network.wan_dev=device
	network.wan_dev.name='nas0'
	network.wan_dev.macaddr='xx:xx:xx:xx:xx:xx'
	network.wan6=interface
	network.wan6.ifname='pppoe-wan'
	network.wan6.proto='dhcpv6'

-> [[wp>G.992.3|Annex]]: use A if not in germany

	uci set network.dsl.annex='a'

-> [[wp>Asynchronous_Transfer_Mode|TransferMode]]: try PTM if ATM is not working

	uci set network.dsl.xfer_mode='ptm'

-> ADSL login data

	uci set network.wan.username='Set_Username'
	uci set network.wan.password='Set_Password'
	uci commit
	/etc/init.d/network reload

